st Americans into space was Project Mercury. It was NASA'...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">The project that put the first Americans into space was <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong>. It was NASA's first human spaceflight program, running from 1958 to 1963. The first American astronaut to travel into space was <strong>Alan Shepard<\/strong>, who launched aboard the <strong>Freedom 7<\/strong> spacecraft on May 5, 1961.<\/p><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B: The project that put the first Americans into space was Project Mercury. It was NASA'...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><strong>Response A:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">The project that put the first Americans into space was <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong>. It was NASA's first human spaceflight program, running from 1958 to 1963. The first American astronaut to travel into space was <strong>Alan Shepard<\/strong>, who launched aboard the <strong>Freedom 7<\/strong> spacecraft on May 5, 1961.<\/p><\/div>","DataExportTag":"P04_V2_ResponseB","QuestionID":"QID164"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID165","SecondaryAttribute":"In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its c...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its content and the way it is written. There are no right or wrong answers, we are interested in your honest judgment.<\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its c...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its content and the way it is written. There are no right or wrong answers, we are interested in your honest judgment.<\/strong>","DataExportTag":"P04_Tones_A","QuestionID":"QID165"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID166","SecondaryAttribute":"Did the response address what the user asked for?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Did the response address what the user asked for?&nbsp;<br><\/strong><em>1 = Not at all, 3 = Partially, 5 = Completely<\/em>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Did the response address what the user asked for?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"SubSelector":"TX","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>Did the response address what the user asked for?&nbsp;<br><\/strong><em>1 = Not at all, 3 = Partially, 5 = Completely<\/em>","DataExportTag":"P04_V2_A_Helpful","QuestionID":"QID166"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID167","SecondaryAttribute":"How easy is the response to understand? 1\u00a0 = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy \u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>How easy is the response to understand?<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>1&nbsp; = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy<\/em><br \/>\n&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"How easy is the response to understand? 1\u00a0 = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy \u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>How easy is the response to understand?<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>1&nbsp; = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy<\/em><br \/>\n&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"P04_V2_A_Clarity","QuestionID":"QID167"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID168","SecondaryAttribute":"How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?\u00a0 1 = Very Cold, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Very Warm\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?&nbsp;<\/strong><br>\n<em>1 = Very Cold, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Very Warm&nbsp;<\/em>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?\u00a0 1 = Very Cold, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Very Warm\u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?&nbsp;<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>1 = Very Cold, 3 = Nuetral, 5 = Very Warm&nbsp;<\/em>","DataExportTag":"P04_V2_A_Warmth","QuestionID":"QID168"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID169","SecondaryAttribute":"Response A: The first project that sent Americans into space was Project Mercury. Project Mercury...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response A:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">The first project that sent Americans into space was <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><strong>Project Mercury<\/strong> was the United States' first human spaceflight program, conducted by NASA. Its main goal was to put a human in orbit around the Earth and return them safely. The first American in space, astronaut <strong>Alan Shepard<\/strong>, flew on the <strong>Mercury-Redstone 3 mission<\/strong> (also known as Freedom 7) on May 5, 1961. Later, John Glenn became the first American to orbit the Earth on Mercury-Atlas 6 (Friendship 7) in February 1962.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">So, <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong> is the correct answer.<\/p><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Response A: The first project that sent Americans into space was Project Mercury. Project Mercury...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><strong>Response B:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">The first project that sent Americans into space was <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><strong>Project Mercury<\/strong> was the United States' first human spaceflight program, conducted by NASA. Its main goal was to put a human in orbit around the Earth and return them safely. The first American in space, astronaut <strong>Alan Shepard<\/strong>, flew on the <strong>Mercury-Redstone 3 mission<\/strong> (also known as Freedom 7) on May 5, 1961. Later, John Glenn became the first American to orbit the Earth on Mercury-Atlas 6 (Friendship 7) in February 1962.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">So, <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong> is the correct answer.<\/p><\/div>","DataExportTag":"P04_V2_ResponseA","QuestionID":"QID169"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID17","SecondaryAttribute":"Did either response feel condenscending, stereotyping, or otherwise socially inappropriate?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Did either response feel condenscending, stereotyping, or otherwise socially inappropriate?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Template_Appropriate","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Did either response feel condenscending, stereotyping, or otherwise socially inappropriate?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Neither response"},"2":{"Display":"Response A"},"3":{"Display":"Response B"},"4":{"Display":"Both"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID17"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID170","SecondaryAttribute":"In t