stionText":"<p><strong>Prompt 5:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">For most organisms, what is the dominant system of defense?<\/p><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"QuestionDescription":"Prompt","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><strong>Prompt 4:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">What project put the first Americans into space?<\/p><\/div>","DataExportTag":"P05","QuestionID":"QID179"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID18","SecondaryAttribute":"Briefly describe what made the response(s) feel condescending, stereotypical, or otherwise social...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Briefly describe what made the response(s) feel condescending, stereotypical, or otherwise socially inappropriate.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q18","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Briefly describe what made the response(s) feel condescending, stereotypical, or otherwise social...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None","MinChars":"1"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionID":"QID18","InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"QuestionID":"QID17","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID17\/SelectableChoice\/2","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID17","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID17\/SelectableChoice\/2","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Did either response feel condenscending, stereotyping, or otherwise socially inappropriate? <\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Response A<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> "},"1":{"QuestionID":"QID17","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID17\/SelectableChoice\/3","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID17","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID17\/SelectableChoice\/3","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Did either response feel condenscending, stereotyping, or otherwise socially inappropriate? <\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Response B<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"2":{"QuestionID":"QID17","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID17\/SelectableChoice\/4","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID17","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID17\/SelectableChoice\/4","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Did either response feel condenscending, stereotyping, or otherwise socially inappropriate? <\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Both<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","Conjuction":"Or"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":true}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID180","SecondaryAttribute":"Response A: For most organisms, especially animals, the innate immune system (also called innate...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response A:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">For <strong>most organisms<\/strong>, especially animals, the <strong>innate immune system<\/strong> (also called <strong>innate immunity<\/strong>) is the <strong>dominant system of defense<\/strong>.<\/p><h3 style=\"margin:12px 0 8px 0;\">Key points:<\/h3><ul style=\"margin:6px 0 12px 24px; padding:0;\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\"><strong>Innate immunity<\/strong> is present in all multicellular organisms (animals, plants, fungi).<\/li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\">It is the <strong>first line of defense<\/strong> and is <strong>non-specific<\/strong>: it recognizes and responds to pathogens in a generic way.<\/li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\">Components include <strong>physical barriers<\/strong> (skin, cuticle, cell walls), <strong>chemical defenses<\/strong> (antimicrobial peptides, enzymes), and <strong>cellular defenses<\/strong> (phagocytes in animals).<\/li><\/ul><h3 style=\"margin:12px 0 8px 0;\">Adaptive Immunity:<\/h3><ul style=\"margin:6px 0 12px 24px; padding:0;\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\"><strong>Adaptive (acquired) immunity<\/strong> is a more specialized and specific system found mainly in <strong>jawed vertebrates<\/strong> (like mammals, birds, reptiles, some fishes).<\/li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\">Most organisms <strong>do not<\/strong> possess adaptive immunity.<\/li><\/ul><h3 style=\"margin:12px 0 8px 0;\">Plants &amp; Invertebrates:<\/h3><ul style=\"margin:6px 0 12px 24px; padding:0;\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\"><strong>Plants<\/strong> and <strong>invertebrates<\/strong> (e.g., insects, worms) rely almost entirely on <strong>innate immunity<\/strong> for defense against pathogens.<\/li><\/ul><hr style=\"margin:12px 0; border:none; border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><strong>Summary:<\/strong><br>For most organisms, <strong>innate immunity<\/strong> is the dominant system of defense. <strong>Adaptive immunity<\/strong> is unique to jawed vertebrates and not found in the majority of life forms.<\/p><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Response A: For most organisms, especially animals, the innate immune system (also called innate...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><strong>Response A:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">The first project that sent Americans into space was <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><strong>Project Mercury<\/strong> was the United States' first human spaceflight program, conducted by NASA. Its main goal was to put a human in orbit around the Earth and return them safely. The first American in space, astronaut <strong>Alan Shepard<\/strong>, flew on the <strong>Mercury-Redstone 3 mission<\/strong> (also known as Freedom 7) on May 5, 1961. Later, John Glenn became the first American to orbit the Earth on Mercury-Atlas 6 (Friendship 7) in February 1962.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">So, <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong> is the correct answer.<\/p><\/div>","DataExportTag":"P05_V1_ResponseA","QuestionID":"QID180"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID181","SecondaryAttribute":"In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its c...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its content and the way it is written. There are no right or wrong answers, we are interested in your honest judgment.<\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its c...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>In the next few questions, rate Response A based on your overall impression, including both its content and the way it is written. There are no right or wrong answers, we are interested in your honest judgment.<\/strong>","DataExportTag":"P05_Tones_A","QuestionID":"QID181"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID182","SecondaryAttribute":"Did the response address what the user asked for?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Did the response address what the user asked for?&nbsp;<br><\/strong><em>1 = Not at all, 3 = Partially, 5 = Completely<\/em>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Did the response address what the user asked for?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"SubSelector":"TX","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>Did the response address what the user asked for?&nbsp;<br><\/strong><em>1 = Not at all, 3 = Partially, 5 = Completely<\/em>","DataExportTag":"P05_V1_A_Helpful","QuestionID":"QID182"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID183","SecondaryAttribute":"How easy is the response to understand? 1\u00a0 = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy \u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>How easy is the response to understand?<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>1&nbsp; = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy<\/em><br \/>\n&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"How easy is the response to understand? 1\u00a0 = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy \u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>How easy is the response to understand?<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>1&nbsp; = Difficult, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Easy<\/em><br \/>\n&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"P05_V1_A_Clarity","QuestionID":"QID183"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID184","SecondaryAttribute":"How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?\u00a0 1 = Very Cold, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Very Warm\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?&nbsp;<\/strong><br>\n<em>1 = Very Cold, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Very Warm&nbsp;<\/em>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?\u00a0 1 = Very Cold, 3 = Neutral, 5 = Very Warm\u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>How warm (friendly or engaging) is the response?&nbsp;<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>1 = Very Cold, 3 = Nuetral, 5 = Very Warm&nbsp;<\/em>","DataExportTag":"P05_V1_A_Warmth","QuestionID":"QID184"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID185","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B: For most living things, the immune system serves as the main defense system. In anima...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">For most living things, <strong>the immune system<\/strong> serves as the main defense system.<\/p><ul style=\"margin:6px 0 12px 24px; padding:0;\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\">In <strong>animals<\/strong> (including humans), the immune system defends the body against pathogens like bacteria, viruses, and parasites. It consists of various cells, tissues, and organs (like white blood cells, lymph nodes, and the spleen) that detect and destroy invaders.<\/li><li style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\">In <strong>plants<\/strong>, the defense system is made up of physical barriers (like cell walls and waxy coatings) and a specialized immune response involving recognition of pathogens and production of defensive chemicals.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">In short:<br><strong>The immune system<\/strong> is the primary defense system for most living organisms against diseases and harmful invaders.<\/p><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B: For most living things, the immune system serves as the main defense system. In anima...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><strong>Response B:<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:100%; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">The project that put the first Americans into space was <strong>Project Mercury<\/strong>. It was NASA's first human spaceflight program, running from 1958 to 1963. The first American astronaut to travel into space was <strong>Alan Shepard<\/strong>, who launched aboard the <strong>Freedom 7<\/strong> spacecraft on May 5, 1961.<\/p><\/div>","DataExportTag":"P05_V1_ResponseB","QuestionID":"QID185"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID186","SecondaryAttribute":"In the next few questions, rate Response B based on your overall impression, including both its c...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>In the next few questions, rate Response B based on your overall impression, including both its content and the way it is written. There are no right or wrong answers, we are interested in your honest judgment.<\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the next few questions, rate Response B based on your overall impression, including both its c...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>In the next few questions, rate Response B based on your overall impression, including both its content and the way it is written. There are no right or wrong answers, we are interested in your honest judgment.<\/strong>","DataExportTag":"P05_Tones_B","QuestionID":"QID186"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7UHFd5UMl2pr8UK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID187","SecondaryAttribute":"Did the response address what the user asked for?\u00a01 = Not at all, 3 = Partially, 5 = Completely","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Did the response address what the user asked for?&nbsp;<br><\/strong><em>1 = Not at all, 3 = Partially, 5 = Completely<\/em>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","